  "description": "*“Number 11, you keep catching my eye.”*\n\nWhen a sudden fire breaks out, an omega escapes from the breeding facility and ends up in a gene-trait brothel called 'STUD'. There, in control of Section C, reigns Lee Beomjae. Whether it was bad luck or a single mistake that started it all, he keeps crossing paths with Yoo Jeong-ah (No. 11) - an omega with nothing but his secondary gender to his name. Even when the establishment is shut down for cleaning, or when he’s suddenly dragged to Section A to serve a client, fate seems to throw him in Beomjae’s way again and again. But this isn’t a fairytale forest - it’s a pit of filth. There’s no princess here.\n\n*“I think I’m going to die. I need an alpha. Or at least something I can use, sir… If I can’t right now, I’ll die- I said I’ll die.”  \n“...Damn it.”*\n\nNo knight is coming to save someone who walked into the mire on his own. Only a monster stands guard - making sure he never escapes. After all, this place is the sewer.\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [Google Play Books](https://play.google.com/store/books/details/BL_%ED%95%98%EC%88%98%EA%B5%AC_1%EA%B6%8C?id=D3cyEQAAQBAJ), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3049056604), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000133899), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/novel/detail.asp?serial_num=sg3952), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11907014)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/plughole), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000139187), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=924046934), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12339163)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13224921)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13224893)",
